    <string name="scr_onb_body_1">JadOO processes the audio of whatever is playing - your music app, video, games - live, on the phone.</string>
    <string name="scr_onb_body_2">Pick your model from 8,000+ lab measurements and JadOO corrects its response toward a neutral target.</string>
